    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A most attractive 3 bedroom end of terrace house situated on the countries  longest street in this mature and much sought after residential location. The property has been fully renovated to a very high standard and is ideally suited to a first time buyer or as an investment opportunity. The property is situated within walking distance of UCC, the Bons Secours Hospital, local schools and sports facilities together with the city centre and all of its amenities and attractions to include various shopping centres, local shops and bars & restaurants."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR\r\nHALLWAY\r\nVinyl Floor, Radiator.\r\nLIVING ROOM                                                                                                                                  12.0 x 10.0\r\nLaminate Wood Floor, Brick Fireplace with Electric Stove, Radiator, Blinds, Power Points.\r\nKITCHEN/DINING ROOM                                                                                                                  13.0 x 9.0                          \r\nVinyl Floor, Wall & Floor Units, Electric Fan, Extractor Fan, Radiator, Power Points.\r\nBATHROOM                                                                                                                                         7.0 x 6.6\r\nCeramic Tile Floor, W.C., W.HB., Shower Cubicle, Radiator, Part Tiled.\r\nSTAIRS & LANDING\r\nCarpet, Guest W.C., Hot Press.\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\nBEDROOM 1                                                                                                                                        8.0 x 6.6\r\nWood Floor, Radiator, Blinds, Power Points.\r\nBEDROOM 2                                                                                                                                      10.6 x 9.6\r\nWood Floor, Radiator, Blinds, Power Points.\r\nBEDROOM 3                                                                                                                                        9.6 x 8.0                   \r\nCarpet, Radiator, Blinds, Power Points"
      },
      {
